Read AGENTS.md before editing. It is the source of truth for rules, commands, and gotchas. CLAUDE.md only points at it.

Keep the game a static page plus `game.js`. Do not add a framework or a bundler. Do not change win, draw, turn, or alert behavior unless the task says to. Leave `try.html` and `try.js` alone. Do not add a LICENSE file.
